{"page":69,"verses":[{"verse_key":"3:149","surah":3,"ayah":149,"ar_uthmani":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِن تُطِيعُوا۟ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ يَرُدُّوكُمْ عَلَىٰٓ أَعْقَـٰبِكُمْ فَتَنقَلِبُوا۟ خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You who believe, if you obey the disbelievers, they will make you revert to your old ways and you will turn into losers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا","en_gloss":"O you","transliteration":"yāayyuhā","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ءَامَنُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"If","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":5,"ar":"تُطِيعُوا۟","en_gloss":"you obey","transliteration":"tuṭīʿū","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَرُدُّوكُمْ","en_gloss":"they will turn you back","transliteration":"yaruddūkum","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":9,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أَعْقَـٰبِكُمْ","en_gloss":"your heels","transliteration":"aʿqābikum","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَتَنقَلِبُوا۟","en_gloss":"then you will turn back","transliteration":"fatanqalibū","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَـٰسِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(as) losers","transliteration":"khāsirīna","verse_key":"3:149"},{"pos":13,"ar":"١٤٩","en_gloss":"(149)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:149"}]},{"verse_key":"3:150","surah":3,"ayah":150,"ar_uthmani":"بَلِ ٱللَّهُ مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ وَهُوَ خَيْرُ ٱلنَّـٰصِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"No indeed! It is God who is your protector: He is the best of helpers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"بَلِ","en_gloss":"Nay","transliteration":"bali","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مَوْلَىٰكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) your Protector","transliteration":"mawlākum","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and He","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":5,"ar":"خَيْرُ","en_gloss":"(is the) best","transliteration":"khayru","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلنَّـٰصِرِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) the Helpers","transliteration":"l-nāṣirīna","verse_key":"3:150"},{"pos":7,"ar":"١٥٠","en_gloss":"(150)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:150"}]},{"verse_key":"3:151","surah":3,"ayah":151,"ar_uthmani":"سَنُلْقِى فِى قُلُوبِ ٱلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ٱلرُّعْبَ بِمَآ أَشْرَكُوا۟ بِٱللَّهِ مَا لَمْ يُنَزِّلْ بِهِۦ سُلْطَـٰنًا ۖ وَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ ٱلنَّارُ ۚ وَبِئْسَ مَثْوَى ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We will strike panic into the disbelievers’ hearts because they attribute partners to God although He has sent no authority for this: their shelter will be the Fire- how miserable is the home of the evildoers!","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَنُلْقِى","en_gloss":"We will cast","transliteration":"sanul'qī","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":2,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قُلُوبِ","en_gloss":"(the) hearts","transliteration":"qulūbi","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(of) those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱلرُّعْبَ","en_gloss":"[the] terror","transliteration":"l-ruʿ'ba","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِمَآ","en_gloss":"because","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَشْرَكُوا۟","en_gloss":"they associated partners","transliteration":"ashrakū","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":9,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"with Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَمْ","en_gloss":"not","transliteration":"lam","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":12,"ar":"يُنَزِّلْ","en_gloss":"He sent down","transliteration":"yunazzil","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"about it","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":14,"ar":"سُلْطَـٰنًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"any authority","transliteration":"sul'ṭānan","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَمَأْوَىٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"and their refuge","transliteration":"wamawāhumu","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلنَّارُ ۚ","en_gloss":"(will be) the Fire","transliteration":"l-nāru","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَبِئْسَ","en_gloss":"and wretched","transliteration":"wabi'sa","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":18,"ar":"مَثْوَى","en_gloss":"(is the) abode","transliteration":"mathwā","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":19,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمِينَ","en_gloss":"[of] the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimīna","verse_key":"3:151"},{"pos":20,"ar":"١٥١","en_gloss":"(151)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:151"}]},{"verse_key":"3:152","surah":3,"ayah":152,"ar_uthmani":"وَلَقَدْ صَدَقَكُمُ ٱللَّهُ وَعْدَهُۥٓ إِذْ تَحُسُّونَهُم بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۖ حَتَّىٰٓ إِذَا فَشِلْتُمْ وَتَنَـٰزَعْتُمْ فِى ٱلْأَمْرِ وَعَصَيْتُم مِّنۢ بَعْدِ مَآ أَرَىٰكُم مَّا تُحِبُّونَ ۚ مِنكُم مَّن يُرِيدُ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَمِنكُم مَّن يُرِيدُ ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۚ ثُمَّ صَرَفَكُمْ عَنْهُمْ لِيَبْتَلِيَكُمْ ۖ وَلَقَدْ عَفَا عَنكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ ذُو فَضْلٍ عَلَى ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God fulfilled His promise to you: you were routing them, with His permission, but then you faltered, disputed the order, and disobeyed, once He had brought you within sight of your goal- some of you desire the gains of this world and others desire the world to come- and then He prevented you from [defeating] them as a punishment. He has now forgiven you: God is most gracious to the believers.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And certainly","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":2,"ar":"صَدَقَكُمُ","en_gloss":"fulfilled to you","transliteration":"ṣadaqakumu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَعْدَهُۥٓ","en_gloss":"His promise","transliteration":"waʿdahu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِذْ","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَحُسُّونَهُم","en_gloss":"you were killing them","transliteration":"taḥussūnahum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۖ","en_gloss":"by His permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'nihi","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":8,"ar":"حَتَّىٰٓ","en_gloss":"until","transliteration":"ḥattā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":9,"ar":"إِذَا","en_gloss":"when","transliteration":"idhā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَشِلْتُمْ","en_gloss":"you lost courage","transliteration":"fashil'tum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَتَنَـٰزَعْتُمْ","en_gloss":"and you fell into dispute","transliteration":"watanāzaʿtum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"concerning","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلْأَمْرِ","en_gloss":"the order","transliteration":"l-amri","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَصَيْتُم","en_gloss":"and you disobeyed","transliteration":"waʿaṣaytum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِّنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":18,"ar":"أَرَىٰكُم","en_gloss":"He (had) shown you","transliteration":"arākum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":19,"ar":"مَّا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":20,"ar":"تُحِبُّونَ ۚ","en_gloss":"you love","transliteration":"tuḥibbūna","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":21,"ar":"مِنكُم","en_gloss":"Among you","transliteration":"minkum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":22,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are some) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":23,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"desire","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":25,"ar":"وَمِنكُم","en_gloss":"and among you","transliteration":"waminkum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":26,"ar":"مَّن","en_gloss":"(are some) who","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":27,"ar":"يُرِيدُ","en_gloss":"desire","transliteration":"yurīdu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":28,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرَةَ ۚ","en_gloss":"the Hereafter","transliteration":"l-ākhirata","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":29,"ar":"ثُمَّ","en_gloss":"Then","transliteration":"thumma","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":30,"ar":"صَرَفَكُمْ","en_gloss":"He diverted you","transliteration":"ṣarafakum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":31,"ar":"عَنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"from them","transliteration":"ʿanhum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":32,"ar":"لِيَبْتَلِيَكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"so that He may test you","transliteration":"liyabtaliyakum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":33,"ar":"وَلَقَدْ","en_gloss":"And surely","transliteration":"walaqad","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":34,"ar":"عَفَا","en_gloss":"He forgave","transliteration":"ʿafā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":35,"ar":"عَنكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"you","transliteration":"ʿankum","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":36,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":37,"ar":"ذُو","en_gloss":"(is the) Possessor","transliteration":"dhū","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":38,"ar":"فَضْلٍ","en_gloss":"(of) Bounty","transliteration":"faḍlin","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":39,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"for","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":40,"ar":"ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ","en_gloss":"the believers","transliteration":"l-mu'minīna","verse_key":"3:152"},{"pos":41,"ar":"١٥٢","en_gloss":"(152)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:152"}]},{"verse_key":"3:153","surah":3,"ayah":153,"ar_uthmani":"۞ إِذْ تُصْعِدُونَ وَلَا تَلْوُۥنَ عَلَىٰٓ أَحَدٍ وَٱلرَّسُولُ يَدْعُوكُمْ فِىٓ أُخْرَىٰكُمْ فَأَثَـٰبَكُمْ غَمًّۢا بِغَمٍّ لِّكَيْلَا تَحْزَنُوا۟ عَلَىٰ مَا فَاتَكُمْ وَلَا مَآ أَصَـٰبَكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ خَبِيرٌۢ بِمَا تَعْمَلُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"You fled without looking back while the Messenger was calling out to you from behind, and God rewarded you with sorrow for sorrow. [He has now forgiven you] so that you may not grieve for what you missed or for what happened to you. God is well aware of everything you do.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"۞ إِذْ","en_gloss":"When","transliteration":"idh","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تُصْعِدُونَ","en_gloss":"you were running uphill","transliteration":"tuṣ'ʿidūna","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَلْوُۥنَ","en_gloss":"casting a glance","transliteration":"talwūna","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":5,"ar":"عَلَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَحَدٍۢ","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadin","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَٱلرَّسُولُ","en_gloss":"while the Messenger","transliteration":"wal-rasūlu","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يَدْعُوكُمْ","en_gloss":"was calling you","transliteration":"yadʿūkum","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِىٓ","en_gloss":"[in]","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":10,"ar":"أُخْرَىٰكُمْ","en_gloss":"(from) behind you","transliteration":"ukh'rākum","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":11,"ar":"فَأَثَـٰبَكُمْ","en_gloss":"So (He) repaid you","transliteration":"fa-athābakum","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":12,"ar":"غَمًّۢا","en_gloss":"(with) distress","transliteration":"ghamman","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِغَمٍّۢ","en_gloss":"on distress","transliteration":"bighammin","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِّكَيْلَا","en_gloss":"so that not","transliteration":"likaylā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":15,"ar":"تَحْزَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"you grieve","transliteration":"taḥzanū","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"over","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":18,"ar":"فَاتَكُمْ","en_gloss":"escaped you","transliteration":"fātakum","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":19,"ar":"وَلَا","en_gloss":"and not","transliteration":"walā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":20,"ar":"مَآ","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":21,"ar":"أَصَـٰبَكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"(had) befallen you","transliteration":"aṣābakum","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":22,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":23,"ar":"خَبِيرٌۢ","en_gloss":"(is) All-Aware","transliteration":"khabīrun","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":24,"ar":"بِمَا","en_gloss":"of what","transliteration":"bimā","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":25,"ar":"تَعْمَلُونَ","en_gloss":"you do","transliteration":"taʿmalūna","verse_key":"3:153"},{"pos":26,"ar":"١٥٣","en_gloss":"(153)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"3:153"}]}]}